BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:df48aa4856f52beb03245f12c1c030ff1bd8849b@authenticatecon.com
DTSTAMP:20261012T182052Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261020T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261020T095500
SUMMARY:Keynotes
LOCATION:Sol 1 - 3\, Omni La Costa Resort & Spa\, 2100 Costa Del Mar Rd\, C
 arlsbad\, CA 92009
DESCRIPTION:Track: Keynote\nSpeakers: Ian Glazer (Crowdstrike)\; Derek Hans
 on (Yubico)\; Eve Maler (Venn Factory)\nThis Talk Was Inevitable | Ian Gla
 zer\, Crowdstrike\nNavigating the Uncertain: The Future of Identity Trust 
 Hangs in the Balance | Derek Hanson\, Yubico\nWhy Passkeys Stall: The Peop
 le and Process Barriers to Adoption | Eve Maler\, Venn Factory\nAgenda: ht
 tps://authenticatecon.com/event/authenticate-u-s-2026/
URL:https://authenticatecon.com/event/authenticate-u-s-2026/
TRANSP:OPAQUE
CATEGORIES:Keynote
