 dle (Authenticate)\nKeynote to be Announced\, Mastercard\nTrust as Infrast
 ructure\nNishant Kaushik\, CTO\, FIDO Alliance\nNew Frontiers in Agentic C
 ommerce: Who's Buying? (Panel) | Dave Birch\, Consult Hyperion (Moderator)
